
Shared by gross check for different models and components:
ctl/               -- Control files, particularly the bounds to be checked
curves/            -- Bounding curves for regions. Esp used by exception checker
exceptions/        -- Exception checker -- print points which aren't 
                           being given an exception for breaking the bounds
graphics/          -- graphics tools
gross/             -- shared python code
model_definitions/ -- defining a model's netcdf arrangement to lift work 
                           away from gross checker

Per model+component
model_component.sh  -- file to kick off evaluation
model_component/    -- directory to hold the specific scripts

